### 1. Create an event
POST http://localhost:5000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "EventEase Test Workshop",
  "description": "Testing event creation and database storage.",
  "dateTime": "2026-11-15T10:00:00.000Z",
  "location": "Main Club Hall",
  "capacity": 2
}

###

### 2. List all events
GET http://localhost:5000/api/events

###

### 3. Register a participant
# Replace YOUR_EVENT_ID with the actual _id from the GET response.
POST http://localhost:5000/api/events/6adb5891a153b277fec5dd95/registrations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "participantName": "Test Participant A",
  "email": "participant.a@example.com"
}

###

GET http://localhost:5000/api/events/6adb5660e812a212f4f41a6c/attendees


